OL,3,GNEWSAThe mum who's spent 40 years
OL,4,Amaking football mascots at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first things you notice when you
OL,7,Fwalk into Angela Hallam's home are a
OL,8,Fburger made out of styrofoam and a
OL,9,Fframed photo of a bulldog mascot above
OL,10,Fthe fireplace.
OL,12,FWhen we meet the 71-year-old in her
OL,13,Fliving room she is sat on her red sofa,
OL,14,Flooking through a scrapbook filled with
OL,15,Fmemories of almost forty years spent
OL,16,Fdesigning and making football mascots.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
