OL,3,GNEWSAThe mum who's spent 40 years
OL,4,Amaking football mascots at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer long history of working with clubs
OL,7,Facross the country starts in Coventry
OL,8,Fin 1987 where Hallam - who had built a
OL,9,Fcareer designing fancy dress costumes
OL,10,Ffor shops - was asked to make a mascot
OL,11,Ffor Wolverhampton Wanderers F.C.
OL,13,F"The next thing I knew I was doing the
OL,14,Ffirst Wolfie - then I did the first
OL,15,FLeicester City, Derby County, Aston
OL,16,FVilla, Coventry City, Birmingham City
OL,17,F[and] West Brom [mascots]," she said.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
